{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41224","headline":"梁郊祀乐章 庆和 五 · 赵光逢","name":"梁郊祀乐章 庆和 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟德动天，有感必通。\n秉兹一德，禋於六宗。\n钦夤宝命，恭肃礼容。\n来顾来享，永穆皇风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}